{"bangumi":{"date":"2013-04-07","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/9d/2b/56091_29nQz.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/9d/2b/56091_29nQz.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/9d/2b/56091_29nQz.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/9d/2b/56091_29nQz.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/9d/2b/56091_29nQz.jpg"},"summary":"在遥远的未来，银河的尽头。人类正与异形的怪生命体展开生存之战。在激战中，少年兵莱德与其乘坐的人型机动兵器Chamber 一起被吞入了不明的时空。在进入人工冬眠的状态后逐渐苏醒的莱德，来到了被遗忘的边境行星——地球。\r\n\r\n被海洋包围的地球此时以及是一片汪洋，地球上的人类们靠乘坐巨大的船只移动，同时不断打捞着旧文明留在海底的物品生存。被船队搭救的莱德登上了其中一艘大船Gargantia，而由于语言、文化、习惯等的不同，莱德对未知的环境感到非常困惑。但无可避免的他必须去学会如何与Gargantia上的人们共同生活，其中还包括少女艾米。于是。不同于战斗的，充满惊喜的翠星生活开始了！","name":"翠星のガルガンティア","name_cn":"翠星之加尔刚蒂亚","tags":[{"name":"虚渊玄","count":1313,"total_count":40204},{"name":"2013年4月","count":786,"total_count":23395},{"name":"Production.I.G","count":722,"total_count":42232},{"name":"翠星之加尔刚蒂亚","count":578,"total_count":587},{"name":"原创","count":525,"total_count":617865},{"name":"萝卜","count":481,"total_count":52548},{"name":"TV","count":475,"total_count":1398004},{"name":"机战","count":421,"total_count":49773},{"name":"2013","count":258,"total_count":68704},{"name":"ProductionI.G","count":230,"total_count":35088},{"name":"科幻","count":222,"total_count":251673},{"name":"金元寿子","count":140,"total_count":2235},{"name":"茅野爱衣","count":91,"total_count":4108},{"name":"村田和也","count":70,"total_count":273},{"name":"阿澄佳奈","count":67,"total_count":4705},{"name":"杉田智和","count":33,"total_count":12958},{"name":"虚淵玄","count":29,"total_count":2138},{"name":"日本","count":29,"total_count":293775},{"name":"石川界人","count":24,"total_count":2234},{"name":"2013年","count":20,"total_count":3971},{"name":"Production_I.G","count":15,"total_count":1765},{"name":"战斗","count":15,"total_count":469215},{"name":"岩代太郎","count":15,"total_count":97},{"name":"治愈","count":14,"total_count":300877},{"name":"伊藤静","count":10,"total_count":1500},{"name":"2013年四月番","count":9,"total_count